# gova-monolith template version.
#
# BUMP THIS whenever anything under src/builder/ changes — generator or
# templates. It is the only thing that lets a derived app say which version of
# the template it was built from, because an app vendors a COPY of src/builder
# and that copy has no link back to this repo afterwards.
#
# Format: YYYY-MM-DD.N — the date of the change and a counter within that day.
# It is compared as an opaque string, never parsed for ordering, so any scheme
# that a human can eyeball works; this one sorts naturally as a bonus.
#
# The first non-comment, non-empty line below is the version.
2026-08-22.1
